{"c":{"284158":["David Martinez","Male","b284158-z1uGKC3IYVa1.png","David is a street kid from Arroyo, Santo Domingo in Night City, who is enrolled into Arasaka's educational system at Arasaka Academy. He lives with his mother Gloria in an apartment of Megabuilding H4.",5503],"284159":["Maine","Male","b284159-RvuKShSpDOS5.png","Maine used to be a military soldier before he became a mercenary. Now a veteran edgerunner in Night City, Maine dreams of \"making it big\", although he values his friendships with his crew more than his own glory.",1060],"287947":["Kate Miller","Female","b287947-ltdXiLP8WfJj.png","",5],"402428":["Weak Kingsley","Male","b402428-c0n4Cmw4J8Bc.jpg","Once known as “King,” a veteran edgerunner at the top of his game, Weak now lives in the shadow of his former glory.",285],"402555":["D","Male","b402555-eLAUsujYzeuk.jpg","A Snake Nation netrunner with sharp technical skills and a sharper hunger for revenge, D hunts the killer who wiped out his clan.",468],"402617":["Roman Carax","Male","b402617-yMF7AH5pKfM7.png","Roman Carax is a young cinephile chasing real stories in a city that’s abandoned film for braindance.",290],"402683":["Talia Yang","Female","b402683-OE7PEewCJi1v.png","Raised in corpo towers but hardened in Maelstrom’s grip, Talia is fiercely independent and steeped in the gang’s hyper-violent, chrome-obsessed culture.",592],"407502":["Avida Yang","Female","b407502-9WamyZ2wLYVb.jpg","Once a jazz singer, corpo insider, and King’s old flame, Avida Yang left her old life behind. Now, her world revolves around one person: Talia.",11],"410878":["Jessie","Female","b410878-qNrRbVV9xejh.png","Jessie is a braindance engineer working at Sal Bigelow’s Braindance Paradise, tuning experiences for those looking to leave Night City behind, at least for a little while.",53],"410879":["Sal Bigelow","Male","b410879-2fxeKMlYfYjK.png","Owner of Braindance Paradise.",3],"410880":["Meshuga","Male","b410880-XH9yPxIKhIma.png","",7],"410881":["Kitano","Male","b4108